## 🔄 Dynamic Data Stream & Signal Handshake Breakdown

### 1. Verification Phase (Form Settings Initialization)

* **Frontend Action:** User profile inputs check karta hai (`authChecked`), target role aur duration parameters select karta hai, aur local resume asset block inject karke button toggle karta hai.
* **Network Pipeline:** HTTP POST parameters schema data `axios.post('/api/interview/initialize')` ke true pipelines hit karke metadata record Prisma client row properties (`durationMinutes`) ke columns mein update karta hai.
* **Handshake Synchronization:** Frontend native WebSocket tunnel open karke dynamic frame signal event drop karta hai:
```typescript
socket.emit("join-interview-session", targetSessionId);

```



### 2. Analytical Inference Engine Block (`THINKING`)

* **Backend Action:** Persistent mapping storage (`globalSessionMemory`) se current state logs fetch karta hai.
* **Token Saver Slide Check:** Continuous track logs truncation layers verify karke calculation sliding array bounded thresholds maintain karta hai:
```javascript
if (computationalChatHistory.length > 6) { /* Keeps System + Last 6 Frames Only */ }

```


* **Dynamic Time Wrap Directive:** Agar continuous synchronization timer frame status window **30 seconds** se lower value compute karega, toh LLM history array trace mein immediate alert append trigger ho jayega:
```text
Forcing boundary wrap rule flag -> State exactly "Let's conclude your interview..."

```


* **Event Loop Emission:** Inference engine prompt configurations match karke text object layout complete karta hai aur broadcast update run karta hai:
```javascript
socket.emit("candidate-transcript-final", { sender: 'ai', text: aiGeneratedQuestion });

```



### 3. Vocal Synthesis Matrix Configuration (`GENERATING_VOICE`)

* **Vocal Core Ingest:** Output string vectors bina kisi dynamic character splicing or cutting parameters limits threshold drop ke direct clean script buffer sequence processing module structure ko hit karte hain.
* **The High-Speed Edge Connection Gateway:** Backend bina kisi third-party external dependency compilation warnings ke Windows Edge framework ka native downstream protocol layer open karta hai aur expressive neural asset layer **`en-US-AvaMultilingualNeural`** voice properties verify karta hai.
* **Binary Processing Event:** Stream compilation direct complete frame array block create karta hai aur array bits emit karta hai:
```javascript
socket.emit("ai-speech-packet", finalCompiledAudioBuffer);

```


* **Automatic Exception Recovery Failover (Priority 4 Strategy):** Agar cloud servers block structural layers down behave kareinge, toh backup trigger message fire hoga taaki frontend locally browser native engines hardware `window.speechSynthesis` execute kar sake:
```javascript
socket.emit("ai-speech-failover", { text: aiGeneratedQuestion });

```



### 4. Playback Locks & Audio Rendering Control (`PLAYING`)

* **Frontend Isolation Logic:** Jaise hi system component par binary speech input frames parse hote hain, frontend instant browser state logic execute karke VAD processing loops ko mutate/mute kar deta hai:
```typescript
await transitionToSilent(); // MicVAD paused explicitly, Native WebSpeech engine stopped

```


* **Audio Buffer Context Delivery:** Raw packets array array data stream bits linear decoding layers `ctx.decodeAudioData(audioBufferArray)` coordinate karke node parameters complete parameters match process map pipeline complete karte hain.
* **Critical Mutex Resumption Guard:** Jab track stream array execution complete structural framework `source.onended` capture karta hai, tab lock dynamic framework flip karke microphone drivers return mode switch state fire karta hai:
```typescript
source.onended = async () => { await transitionToListening(); }; // State flips back to LISTENING

```



### 5. Capture Feed & Transcriptions Cascade (`LISTENING` ──► `FINAL_TRANSCRIBING`)

* **The Optimistic Interface Matrix:** Jab user bolna shuru karta hai, browser internal local frame engines `SpeechRecognition` sequence text arrays parse karke overlay state text parameters change blocks *instantly real-time view template container* me type karta hai:
```typescript
setInterimText(runningInterimBuffer); // Optimistic UI layout typed instantly

```


* **Silence Boundary Processing Event:** Jab physical noise input silence detection drop boundaries cross karta hai, tab Silero VAD `.onnx` weight validation algorithms model instance process map coordinate handle matrix close block fire karke float arrays capture signal map trigger karta hai:
```typescript
socket.emit("candidate-voice-stream", audioFloat32Array);

```


* **Ingestion Transcription Matrix Processing:** Backend binary array files instant raw WAV format elements parameters layout file storage path coordinate layers par append karke data directly process logic bounds par pass karta hai:
```javascript
const transcription = await groq.audio.transcriptions.create({ model: 'whisper-large-v3' });

```


* **Memory Commit Loopback Execution:** Output candidate text parsing framework directly memory dynamic mappings aur dynamic databases tables elements parameters (`prisma.interviewMessage.create`) me persistence layer update pass karke dubaara sequence trigger handle frame check open kar deta hai:
```javascript
await runAgentInferenceLoop(socket); // Repeats loop indefinitely until session status completes

```



